  "metadata": {
    "title": "Drum Kit",
    "description": "A synthesized kit on General MIDI-style keys: kick 35-37, snare 38-40, closed hats 41-43 and 46 open, toms 44-45 and 47 up (pitched by key). Every voice computes all drums and the key selects which one sounds. The demo plays four bars at 110 BPM."
